<!-- The N.D. Okla. complaint's Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs; docs/EVAL-LOOP.md,
     "Cross-engine gate") in the face of the typst template ({font}, Times New Roman; LGnR2-4(a) names no face) at
     12 pt (size 24 half points, LGnR2-4(a): not smaller than 12 point); Body Text in 27.6 pt line boxes (552 twips:
     typst pitch-body, the face's double spacing, twice its 13.8 pt single line; LGnR2-4(a) asks for double spacing
     and bars "Exactly 24 pt") with a half-inch first-line indent; single lines in 13.8 pt boxes (276 twips: typst
     pitch-single). Letter page with one-inch margins (LGnR2-4(a)), the page number centred at 12 pt on every page
     in a single-pitch line whose box ends 0.5 in above the page edge (typst footer-distance).
     docx/oknd-complaint.lua writes every paragraph's own spacing. Twips: 20 x pt. -->
